    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cat Girl Survivor: Bullet Action&quot; is a shooting action game that combines the simple gameplay of a vampire-like survival game with diverse characters, equipment items, skills, and play modes. Choose your own character, acquire various equipment and skills, and save the cat girl world threatened by demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/f8617eb30619085460febd5958e1d4a5.avif?t=1753771493\" width=600 height=78 /></span> A <strong>Colorful Skills and Casting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To effectively take down demons, make use of a variety of skills and the unique casting skill system exclusive to &quot;Cat Girl Survivor: Bullet Action.&quot; The casting skill has a critical weakness: you can\u2019t move while charging its power. However, it delivers wide-ranging and powerful damage to enemies as a reward. Strategically combine casting skills with regular skills to efficiently defeat demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/39c9224c338282fff0875c76e5bf9b85.avif?t=1753771493\" width=600 height=78 /></span> level up your skills to Legendary status to enjoy colorful and cool strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/68d546e058ca4d43a91114c5b542a673.poster.avif?t=1753771493\" width=598 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/68d546e058ca4d43a91114c5b542a673.webm?t=1753771493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/68d546e058ca4d43a91114c5b542a673.mp4?t=1753771493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/6d251e0f9d1598c8fed45cbea89d6281.avif?t=1753771493\" width=600 height=78 /></span> <strong>Diverse Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the default character, there are unique characters with different skills and abilities. Pick a character that suits your playstyle and charms you\u2014whether it\u2019s Akane, Shiro, Koro, or others\u2014and dive into the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/1852adaeecd0090001402a7421a7a840.poster.avif?t=1753771493\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/1852adaeecd0090001402a7421a7a840.webm?t=1753771493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Gameplay Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cat Girl Survivor: Bullet Action&quot; offers more than just a story mode. Enjoy diverse play modes like \u2018Adventure Mode\u2019 and \u2018Infinite Dungeon.\u2019 Experience the primal thrill of infinite dungeons from classic vampire-like games and the fresh fun of a roguelike system in \u2018Adventure Mode\u2019 for a rich and varied gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cat Girl Survivor: Bullet Action&quot; is a shooting action game that combines the simple gameplay of a vampire-like survival game with diverse characters, equipment items, skills, and play modes. Choose your own character, acquire various equipment and skills, and save the cat girl world threatened by demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/f8617eb30619085460febd5958e1d4a5.avif?t=1753771493\" width=600 height=78 /></span> A <strong>Colorful Skills and Casting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To effectively take down demons, make use of a variety of skills and the unique casting skill system exclusive to &quot;Cat Girl Survivor: Bullet Action.&quot; The casting skill has a critical weakness: you can\u2019t move while charging its power. However, it delivers wide-ranging and powerful damage to enemies as a reward. Strategically combine casting skills with regular skills to efficiently defeat demons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/39c9224c338282fff0875c76e5bf9b85.avif?t=1753771493\" width=600 height=78 /></span> level up your skills to Legendary status to enjoy colorful and cool strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/68d546e058ca4d43a91114c5b542a673.poster.avif?t=1753771493\" width=598 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/289094